    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"TypeBasedAggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>TypeBasedAggregationOperationContext</code></a> for the given type, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../convert/QueryMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>QueryMapper</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的类型、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"类或接口 in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> 和\n<a href=\"../convert/QueryMapper.html\" title=\"类 in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>QueryMapper</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"TypeBasedAggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 中的类\"><code>TypeBasedAggregationOperationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>type</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>type</code> 不得为 null。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mappingContext</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>mappingContext</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mapper</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>mapper</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations of <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a> retain their <a href=\"FieldLookupPolicy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>FieldLookupPolicy</code></a>. If no policy is\nspecified, then lookup defaults to <a href=\"FieldLookupPolicy.html#strict()\"><code>FieldLookupPolicy.strict()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实现<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a>的实例会保留其<a href=\"FieldLookupPolicy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>FieldLookupPolicy</code></a>。如果未指定策略，则查找默认采用<a href=\"FieldLookupPolicy.html#strict()\"><code>FieldLookupPolicy.strict()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a nested <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a> from this context that exposes <a href=\"ExposedFields.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>fields</code></a>.",
      "translation": "从此上下文创建一个嵌套的<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a>，该上下文暴露了<a href=\"ExposedFields.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>fields</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a nested <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a> from this context that inherits exposed fields from this\ncontext and exposes <a href=\"ExposedFields.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>fields</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个嵌套的<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 中的接口\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a>，该上下文继承自当前上下文中暴露的字段，并暴露<a href=\"ExposedFields.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 中的类\"><code>fields</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This toggle allows the <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>context</code></a> to use any given field name without checking for\nits existence. Typically, the <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a> fails when referencing unknown fields, those that\nare not present in one of the previous stages or the input source, throughout the pipeline.",
      "translation": "此开关允许 <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>context</code></a> 使用任意给定的字段名，而无需检查其是否存在。通常情况下，<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a> 在引用未知字段时会失败，这些字段未在管道中的任何先前阶段或输入源中出现。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"ExposedFields.FieldReference.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ExposedFields.FieldReference</code></a> for the field with the given name.",
      "translation": "返回给定名称字段的<a href=\"ExposedFields.FieldReference.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 包中的接口\"><code>ExposedFields.FieldReference</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
