      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"Fields.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Fields</code></a> exposed by the type. May be a class or an interface. The default\nimplementation uses <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/BeanUtils.html#getPropertyDescriptors(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans\"><code>property descriptors</code></a> discover fields from a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回该类型暴露的 <a href=\"Fields.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 包中的类\"><code>Fields</code></a>。可以是类或接口。默认实现使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/BeanUtils.html#getPropertyDescriptors(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"org.springframework.beans 包中的类或接口\"><code>属性描述符</code></a> 从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 包中的类或接口\"><code>Class</code></a> 发现字段。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a> aware of a particular type and a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> to potentially translate\nproperty references into document field names.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a> 感知到特定类型以及一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>，以便潜在地将属性引用转换为文档字段名称。",
      "count": 1
